        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an ostrich farm owner, where your goal is to breed the most striking ostriches. It's more than just about looks; smart strategies, good timing, and a little bit of luck will take your business to a whole new level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/e787813ab48e6670f490ab517851a9e9.webp?t=1768733602\" width=617 height=53 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Breed Colorful Ostriches:</strong> Selectively breed a multitude of extravagant ostriches. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fulfill Orders:</strong> Your birds are in high demand! Deliver the requested ostriches to earn rewards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Your Collection:</strong> Unlock collection cards for all possible color combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Watch Your Ostriches Interact:</strong> Observe delightful mating dances and social behaviors. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Expand Your Farm:</strong> Expand your farm to provide more space for your growing ostrich population. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Collect Achievements:</strong> Challenge yourself and collect achievements that reflect your expertise as a skilled ostrich breeder. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/bea03477014a23e1ce54783ac718221f.webp?t=1768733602\" width=617 height=53 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Social Behavior</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe charming dances when your ostriches try to impress each other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/28d1d84c67c974a3403768c13c1ed1d8.poster.avif?t=1768733602\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/28d1d84c67c974a3403768c13c1ed1d8.webm?t=1768733602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/28d1d84c67c974a3403768c13c1ed1d8.mp4?t=1768733602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Baby Steps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the first steps of your baby ostriches. Every hatchling brings a fresh wave of excitement and potential. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/e49e42d4865190929f824773d2b15065.poster.avif?t=1768733602\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/e49e42d4865190929f824773d2b15065.webm?t=1768733602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/e49e42d4865190929f824773d2b15065.mp4?t=1768733602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use rewards to enhance your breeding strategies and boost your farm's productivity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/a106097565f2e631549dfb7d2991adf5.poster.avif?t=1768733602\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/a106097565f2e631549dfb7d2991adf5.webm?t=1768733602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/a106097565f2e631549dfb7d2991adf5.mp4?t=1768733602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an ostrich farm owner, where your goal is to breed the most striking ostriches. It's more than just about looks; smart strategies, good timing, and a little bit of luck will take your business to a whole new level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/e787813ab48e6670f490ab517851a9e9.webp?t=1768733602\" width=617 height=53 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Breed Colorful Ostriches:</strong> Selectively breed a multitude of extravagant ostriches. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fulfill Orders:</strong> Your birds are in high demand! Deliver the requested ostriches to earn rewards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Your Collection:</strong> Unlock collection cards for all possible color combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Watch Your Ostriches Interact:</strong> Observe delightful mating dances and social behaviors. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Expand Your Farm:</strong> Expand your farm to provide more space for your growing ostrich population. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Collect Achievements:</strong> Challenge yourself and collect achievements that reflect your expertise as a skilled ostrich breeder. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/bea03477014a23e1ce54783ac718221f.webp?t=1768733602\" width=617 height=53 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Social Behavior</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe charming dances when your ostriches try to impress each other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/28d1d84c67c974a3403768c13c1ed1d8.poster.avif?t=1768733602\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/28d1d84c67c974a3403768c13c1ed1d8.webm?t=1768733602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/28d1d84c67c974a3403768c13c1ed1d8.mp4?t=1768733602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Baby Steps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the first steps of your baby ostriches. Every hatchling brings a fresh wave of excitement and potential. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/e49e42d4865190929f824773d2b15065.poster.avif?t=1768733602\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/e49e42d4865190929f824773d2b15065.webm?t=1768733602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/e49e42d4865190929f824773d2b15065.mp4?t=1768733602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use rewards to enhance your breeding strategies and boost your farm's productivity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/a106097565f2e631549dfb7d2991adf5.poster.avif?t=1768733602\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/a106097565f2e631549dfb7d2991adf5.webm?t=1768733602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549930/extras/a106097565f2e631549dfb7d2991adf5.mp4?t=1768733602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
